{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_chyue_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_chyue_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"昔我往矣","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_chyue_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"56d785cc85c7f0908b5d2d9d1db57139d6df942c8052f0608570d7e0c49a4935","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g5_swordcastingworkshop"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"加把勁，沒差幾鍬土了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你就這麼袖著手在一邊看著？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"俗話說，“袖手旁觀”嘛。難道是我不想幫你？誰讓我傷了胳膊來著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好好好......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"百夫長","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"將軍，酒買來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣遼","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼去了這麼久？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"百夫長","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽說我們大勝歸來，百姓們也在慶祝。今天好幾家客棧都爆滿，人手不夠，運貨的馱獸把路都給堵住了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"百夫長","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我當了小半天夥計，幫他們卸完了貨，才趕過來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣遼","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"身為玉門軍人，除了在戰場上奮勇爭先，日常也要有幫助百姓的自覺，很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"百夫長","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多謝將軍。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我來看看。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朔","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“烈刀子”“五碗倒”“不過橋”......嗯？還有江南的湖松酒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朔","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"左兄，你今天可不能拿“公務在身”當藉口了，不然可就浪費了這些好酒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣遼","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......自然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"百夫長","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"見過宗師。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朔","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大江兄弟，辛苦了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"百夫長","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"應、應該的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"軍士將滿載著酒的推車停穩，抬眼看眼前的庭院。\n城南鑄劍坊，玉門口碑最好的鑄造工坊，承接了巡防營大批軍用器械的訂單，坊主孟鐵衣與平祟侯和守城宗師還是好友，平日往來密切。\n軍營無需值勤的日子，眾人常常來鑄劍坊與江湖俠士們聚會，比武切磋，彈劍宴飲，爐火與談笑聲齊高。\n他偶爾也跟著過來，但今天這間院子有些不一樣——\n靠門口的數十塊青磚被掀開，挖出的深坑裡，突兀種下了一棵老槐樹，枝葉交錯，占去好大一塊地方。\n槐樹粗約兩人合抱，樹皮的紋路裡夾著細細的沙粒，粗糲得像是老人的手掌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朔","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看這棵老槐，大概有一百多歲了，就這麼貿然移栽到移動城市裡，也不知道能不能適應......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣遼","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"總比你效仿古人在樹幹上刻錄自己的戰功，再不管不問要好吧？老樹最怕傷皮骨，扔在那黃沙深處，說不定就真枯死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朔","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"話雖如此......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣遼","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"樹是女俠出主意扛回來的，待會她來了，聽到你一直念叨，指不定要發脾氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣遼","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再說樹與人無異，能在戈壁裡活這麼久，也不要小瞧了它的生命力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣遼","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以後有鐵衣照顧，明年來看，肯定就是一樹新葉了，正好乘涼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朔","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說的也是。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你們倒是會給我找事情做......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟鐵衣","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當時就不該讓你們把這樹扛回來......我也被太陽曬暈了頭了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朔","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你這鑄劍坊，除了爐子就是兵器，多些生機，也是好事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟鐵衣","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了算了，說不過你們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟鐵衣","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？酒已經到了，正好飯菜也準備好了。樹栽得差不多了吧，趕緊進屋！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"百夫長","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那將軍、宗師、孟坊主，我就先回軍營了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朔","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為何要走？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"百夫長","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您和將軍的聚會......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朔","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這次追剿流寇，你們左將軍還沒來得及為你記功，慶功宴會，哪有只讓人買酒不讓人入席的道理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣遼","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......聽宗師的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"百夫長","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"百夫長","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我把酒搬進去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g13_yanlivingroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟鐵衣","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟鐵衣","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這月亮居然能比老槐樹高那麼多，奇哉怪也。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣遼","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鐵衣，你喝多了，眼花了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟鐵衣","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喝多了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟鐵衣","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不不不，還早得很。平日裡鍛刀打劍的時候，我都要在旁邊放一罈子酒。幹什麼？喝一口，這一錘子下去的力氣都能大三分！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣遼","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟鐵衣","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"平祟侯身為玉門將軍，領兵禦敵的本事，在場沒人比得過你。但說到喝酒和武功，呵......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣遼","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，你話別說一半，我的武功怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣遼","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這次清剿流寇，追入黃沙百餘里，我難道沒有衝在最前面？我降服的敵人未必比你少，身上的傷口未必沒你多！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟鐵衣","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣遼","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你看我這左臂，這一刀，差半寸，就傷到了經脈......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟鐵衣","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"挽袖子有什麼用，平祟侯要不要看看我後背上，有道新傷還是替你擋的呢！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"百夫長","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朔","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在什麼時辰了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"百夫長","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"宗師，已經子時了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"鑄劍坊的堂屋已經擠滿了人，軍士和宗師之間，隔著好幾桌，他提高了音量，也不知道對方聽沒聽清楚。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"空酒罈緊貼著桌腳擺放。罈子越多，宴會的喧聲越高。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"醉得大了舌頭的擂台榜高手，和江湖人比拼傷痕的玉門將軍......軍士回想起白天眾人在戰場上的模樣，他覺得自己醉得不輕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清亮的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"問時辰幹嘛？醉了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清亮的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你這酒量還比不過你那個妹妹。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"聲音清亮悅耳，但語氣很是隨意。\n軍士聽出那是經常跟在宗師身邊的女俠，不知道她什麼時候入的席。她坐在宗師對面，自己只能看到背影。\n沒人知道女俠為什麼來到玉門，只知道她和宗師、平祟侯、孟坊主都交好，聽說她和宗師“不打不相識”，打那後便留在了這裡。\n同隊的兄弟們都和女俠打過交道，一個勁誇她劍法強酒量好，性格又灑脫，快人快語，很討人喜歡。\n但陰差陽錯的，軍士竟一直沒機會見她長什麼樣子。\n軍士突然有些好奇，忍不住站起身，但坐在旁邊的鏢客見他碗空了，又趕緊給他倒滿了酒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朔","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是說令？對了，她之前遊歷到玉門的時候，你們見過的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朔","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"醒在夢裡，醉在夢外，醉沒醉，對她來說無所謂。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女俠","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"又開始說些我聽不懂的話，看來是真醉了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朔","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女俠","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這次出征，我們也折了不少人，回來的，多多少少都帶著傷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朔","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女俠","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"有個問題，我一直想問你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女俠","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"一個人身經百戰，愣是半點傷都沒受過，要說是武功高強，未免也高強過了頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女俠","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"還有你的名字——“朔”，是什麼意思？哪有人就叫個單字的，不像個人類名字，倒像個什麼代號。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朔","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是另一個妹妹起的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女俠","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我聽說過名字由父母長輩起的，由老師起的，由算命先生起的......由比你晚出生的妹妹起，是個什麼道理？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朔","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們兄弟姐妹，都是這樣......說來話長了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣遼","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣遼","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"宗師，你貪杯了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女俠","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你又來幫他打馬虎眼......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女俠","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......算了，不問了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朔","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不如......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朔","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"各位幫我取個“人類”名字吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣遼","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣遼","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"宗師？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朔","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"左將軍，今日難得酒興，不也是好事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣遼","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟鐵衣","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看行！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟鐵衣","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自打玉門擂台榜開設以來，上面的第一名始終都空著，全城人都知道該屬於誰。我這個擂台榜第二名，竟然在你手底下走不過十招。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟鐵衣","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"宗師武功蓋世，不如就叫“無敵”吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣遼","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣遼","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你自己聽聽，好聽嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣遼","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"非要取的話，不如叫“定瀾”，取“保境安民、平波定瀾”的意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣遼","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或者“安蒼”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟鐵衣","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"文縐縐的，念都念不明白......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臉紅的鏢客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"叫“千鈞”吧，上次宗師給我們示範拳法，那一拳打在身上，好傢伙，像是有千斤重。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"耳熱的參謀","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不好，應該叫“清晏”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臉紅的鏢客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"耳熱的參謀","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"緊鎖著眉頭......平祟侯、鑄劍坊主......在場的所有人都緊鎖著眉頭。\n男人的目光掃到了自己，軍士一碗酒送到一半，又放了下來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"百夫長","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"宗師......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朔","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大江兄弟，你有什麼想法沒有？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"百夫長","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我、我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"百夫長","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我老家的人，都是看見了什麼，就給孩子取什麼名字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"百夫長","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒讀過什麼書，幫、幫不上宗師......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女俠","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"吵死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女俠","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哪有那麼麻煩。讓我想想。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"長身玉立的女俠起身，她端了碗酒，徑直穿過一地的空罈子，和爭得面紅耳赤的賓客。\n女俠打開了窗戶，夜風灌滿了整個房間，所有人都安靜了下來。\n雙月高懸，夜已經深了。但玉門這座移動的軍事要塞沒有睡著的時候，非居民區的軍用源石燈徹夜長明，深夜視野依然不會受阻。\n遠方群山連綿，恣意睡臥，像是雲上有人抖腕，甩下了濃重的、凝滯的墨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朔","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女俠","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"雖說那些山在各人看來，各有不同，但它們一直就在那，所有人抬眼便能瞧見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女俠","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“重岳”，怎麼樣？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣遼","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟鐵衣","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“重岳”。\n軍士把這兩個字嚼了兩遍，讀不懂，只是覺得很有氣勢，確實比“定瀾”和“無敵”都好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他偷偷看坐在不遠處的宗師。男人還是那副表情，沒有太大的悲喜，但眼神很亮。\n他突然想起十多年前，自己被調撥到玉門的第一天，宗師破例來到演武場參觀。\n剛入伍的軍士幾乎都聽過宗師的傳說，忍不住看，他坦然回應每一道目光。\n以及後來的無數個戰場，無數個日夜。玉門城縱橫沙海之上，從未停歇，十多年轉瞬即逝......\n他很熟悉宗師的眼神，不怒自威，透亮，更多的是冷靜。這冷靜讓人覺得安心，卻又有些陌生。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朔","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“重岳”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"耳熱的參謀","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“重岳”好啊！重山疊岳，下能挽黃沙，上可截流雲。文雅，讀起來又順口，不愧是女俠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臉紅的鏢客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"就......就你話多......人家女俠的心思，用得著你來解讀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟鐵衣","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是個好名字，配得上宗師的氣象。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟鐵衣","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為這個名字，我們再乾一杯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"半醉的眾人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"敬重岳！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"敬各位。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g5_swordcastingworkshop"},{"type":"narration","text":"昨天沒有開門營業，坊主也就忘了給鍛造爐續火。晨風越過院牆，直撲在臉上，軍士覺得自己的酒瞬間醒了大半。\n頭還是有些疼，他只記得昨晚大家紛紛舉起酒碗，慶祝宗師得了個好名字。觥籌交錯，有人唱起軍營裡的歌謠，唱著唱著竟然流了眼淚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"百夫長","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我該不是花了眼......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"才過了一夜，再看那棵老槐，已經不覺得突兀。倒是樹下站著的男人，讓軍士吃了一驚。\n他本打算悄悄離開，卻已經被對方聽到了動靜。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"早上好。我記得你今天不需要值勤，怎麼不多休息一會？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"百夫長","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"平時習慣這個時間醒了......又多喝了幾杯，也沒睡好......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這年復一年的征戰，的確是苦了你們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"百夫長","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"宗師怎麼也起這麼早，還是說，您一夜沒睡......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"百夫長","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"宗師，昨天晚上人多，我沒敢上前給您敬酒......我是想，無論如何都得說聲謝謝的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"百夫長","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幾天前，最後那一場仗！您救了我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"百夫長","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當時我只顧著死死按住面前那個流寇，沒注意到身後的刀，是您替我擋下了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"百夫長","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不然就算我這次戰功足夠升官，也只能是追封了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"百夫長","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您應該，不會記得......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果可以的話，我也想救下每一位戰友......可沙場無情，變數太多，終究做不到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"百夫長","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"宗師，大家既然敢來玉門從軍，當然都是有準備的！我確實怕死，但也沒那麼怕死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可你現在不還好好地活著？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要活著，就該好好珍惜生命。要努力活到可以回家的那一天，回去陪還在等著你的家人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"百夫長","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我不願意瞞您，我馬上就要離開玉門了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"調防到其他地方？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"百夫長","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不、不是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"百夫長","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多虧了您，我這回從戰場上撿回了一條命。可之前受的傷，半年來老是復發，醫生說經脈沒法癒合完全，這隻手以後怕是握不動刀了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"百夫長","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"左將軍體恤下屬，已經批准了我提前退伍，我收拾一下東西，這個月內應該就要回家了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"百夫長","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"家裡還有個老母親，我也沒別的兄弟姐妹，從軍十幾年了，大大小小打了快一百場仗，卻來不及回一趟家，沒照顧過她老人家一天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎會如此......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"百夫長","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"倒也不算什麼。這隻手就算握不住刀，拿鋤頭犁個地還是不成問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"百夫長","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"朝廷對我們這些軍士也夠意思，我退伍後的待遇，還是按百夫長來算。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"百夫長","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......宗師，和您說句心裡話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"百夫長","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道自己不能再當兵的時候，是發自內心地捨不得其他兄弟，捨不得您和左將軍，捨不得玉門。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"百夫長","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我以前和大伙老是喊著“黃沙裹屍”，但是知道自己能活著回家，心裡竟然有一些慶幸......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"百夫長","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最近老是想著，要是戰死了，就算撫恤金寄到老家，我娘就算有了那筆錢，又要怎麼過日子呢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"百夫長","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您會不會，把我當逃兵看......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是什麼話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你這傷，就是這些年保家衛國的證明。誰有資格指責你的不是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算回到老家，安安穩穩種幾畝地，多產些糧食，同樣是為國為民的好事。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"老槐落下了一片葉子，從一百里外的地方突然移栽過來，哪怕生長環境變得好了，也還是會不適應。\n殘留的酒意拉近了兩人的距離，軍士看了看身旁的男人。\n哪怕是傳說裡再可望不可及的人物，此刻站在自己身邊，也只像是一位和藹可親的兄長。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"百夫長","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"宗師，我有一個問題，但是，不太敢問......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你我出生入死，即是同袍，不過是平時職務有別，沒什麼機會說話，何必這樣生分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"百夫長","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈......有您這句話，我覺得以前那些危險，都值了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"百夫長","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"宗師，您又是為什麼要守在玉門城？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難道不是和這裡的每一位將士一樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"百夫長","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您和我們不一樣，您和左將軍也不一樣......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"百夫長","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我剛來的時候，就有老兵跟我說您已經在玉門駐守很久了，可我現在都成了老兵，您還是這副模樣......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"百夫長","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大家都叫您宗師，但好像從來沒人知道您到底是什麼官職......明明出生入死，朝廷卻好像從來不會嘉獎您的功績......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"百夫長","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您也沒有家室......那位女俠在玉門這麼久了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"百夫長","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還是說，因為您天下無敵，戰場上的刀劍流矢對您來說，都算不上一回事，您才沒有什麼顧慮......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"男人的眼神陡然銳利起來，軍士這才驚覺自己說了一些不該說的話，殘存的醉意也消失得無影無蹤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"百夫長","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"宗師恕罪！我......我失言了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說的，倒也沒錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我確實和你們不同。這一點，沒什麼可藏掖的，藏也藏不住。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"百夫長","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但即便不同，又有什麼關係呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這片黃沙何其遼闊，何其困苦，但這裡是大炎的屏障。身後，都是一個個自己牽掛的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無數的將士留守在這裡，歷苦難，見生死，為的肯定不止功名利祿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們每個人，莫非都問了自己“為什麼要留守在這裡”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個問題的答案，真的有那麼重要嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們，未必真有什麼區別。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且你看，我不也有了一個和你們一樣的名字？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"百夫長","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣遼","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"宗師，現在方便說話嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔？有什麼事直說吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣遼","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣遼","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是要緊事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"百夫長","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"左將軍，宗師，那我先回軍營了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣遼","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"京城的信使昨夜剛到，召你回去述職。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣遼","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"朝廷看近期邊境戰事平定，對你的職務或許有些別的安排。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這一次的時間怎麼隔得如此近？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣遼","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可是在司歲台看來，你停留在玉門的時間，也不短了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣遼","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"信是由信使直接遞送給我的。大概除了司歲台，兵部也給了壓力......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"......\n軍士從鑄劍坊退了出來，掩上了門，院子裡兩人的話音逐漸低了下去......\n剛才和男人的那一番對話彷彿又變得不真切了。\n軍士緊了緊甲胄，按住了自己隱隱作痛的胳膊。\n早晨的風還是吹得冷啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g6_yumengate"},{"type":"narration","text":"半月後"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"驛館的夥計","speakerId":"avg_npc_797_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大江兄弟，這兩罈酒算我請的，給你放車上了啊，路上慢慢喝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"驛館的夥計","speakerId":"avg_npc_797_1","isRemote":false,"text":"趕馱獸的時候慢點，別把罈子給顛破了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"退役的軍士","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼好意思，都拿了你這麼多東西了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"驛館的夥計","speakerId":"avg_npc_797_1","isRemote":false,"text":"廢什麼話，一起扛過刀的交情，你跟我掰扯這個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"驛館的夥計","speakerId":"avg_npc_797_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼，要走了，就連兄弟都不認了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"退役的軍士","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪的話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"驛館的夥計","speakerId":"avg_npc_797_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過話說回來，你現在的樣子，我還真看不習慣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"退役的軍士","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"脫了軍裝，沒那麼帥氣了對吧？畢竟這麼多年了，雖然還沒到退伍年齡，但從軍畢竟老得快......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"驛館的夥計","speakerId":"avg_npc_797_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別貧嘴了。回到家就安分過日子，要是討了老婆有了娃，記得來封信，讓大伙也跟著高興一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"驛館的夥計","speakerId":"avg_npc_797_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有機會，能回來看看更好，還請你喝酒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"退役的軍士","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"記得，一定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"退役的軍士","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"保重啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"驛館的夥計","speakerId":"avg_npc_797_1","isRemote":false,"text":"保重。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"驛館的夥計","speakerId":"avg_npc_797_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正巧，今天也是宗師出征的日子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"驛館的夥計","speakerId":"avg_npc_797_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就當一併給你們送行了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"驛館的夥計","speakerId":"avg_npc_797_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了大江兄弟，宗師這次，又要去哪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"退役的軍士","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"驛館的夥計","speakerId":"avg_npc_797_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"退役的軍士","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"長亭復短亭，沙淨草木青。\n幾行歸塞盡，念爾獨何之。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
